1
00:00:00,090 --> 00:00:01,160
You'll trip.

2
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:01,985
Say the ink colour,

3
00:00:01,985 --> 00:00:03,060
not the word.

4
00:00:03,060 --> 00:00:04,021
Go!

5
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:05,630
Tripped, right?

6
00:00:05,630 --> 00:00:06,456
You can't switch

7
00:00:06,456 --> 00:00:08,060
reading OFF.

8
00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:09,716
It runs on autopilot...

9
00:00:09,716 --> 00:00:11,040
the word just barges

10
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:12,700
straight into your mouth.

11
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:14,100
Now these.

12
00:00:14,670 --> 00:00:15,690
Easy, right?

13
00:00:15,690 --> 00:00:17,700
No words... no trip.

14
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:18,748
Little kids who can't

15
00:00:18,748 --> 00:00:19,510
read yet?

16
00:00:19,510 --> 00:00:21,233
They breeze right through.

17
00:00:21,274 --> 00:00:22,091
But kids who

18
00:00:22,091 --> 00:00:23,930
JUST learned to read?

19
00:00:23,930 --> 00:00:25,089
They trip the hardest

20
00:00:25,089 --> 00:00:26,367
of all.

21
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:27,340
Now read the WORDS

22
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:28,610
out loud.

23
00:00:28,710 --> 00:00:29,970
Easy, huh?

24
00:00:30,404 --> 00:00:31,420
Show-off.

